(l)
"Subscriber" means a member of the Fund;
(m)
"Year" means a financial year;
(n)
"Secretary" means Secretary of the Board;
(o)
Words and expressions used and not defined in these rules, but defined in the Provident Fund Act, 1925 (
19 of 1925
) and the Fundamental Rules shall have the meanings respectively assigned to them in those Acts.
